## App flow
```
Visit proflet.com
  → Landing page
  → Click Get Started
  → Auth (login/signup)
  → After login, App.jsx checks subscriptions table
  → No active subscription → Paywall (£19/year button)
  → Click pay → Stripe checkout → stripe-webhook fires → subscriptions updated
  → Success.jsx verifies payment → redirects to Dashboard
  → Active subscription → Dashboard (full app)
```

